www/elinks: Update elinks to version elinks-0.20.0

Update prepared in wip by adr

Delete incompatibility with extinct felinks
Switch to quickjs-ng
Delete applied patches upstream and add fixes not present on last
release

Elinks 0.20.0
-------------
Released on 2026-07-26
* bump mozjs to 140
* switch from quickjs to quickjs-ng
* Added color "default" in colors settings (\e[39m and \e[49m
sequences)
* support for SVG #423
* infinite loop in mailcap code #425
* Use /usr/bin/env to determine awk interpreter path for awk example
scripts #426
* skip DNS lookup for local files which have empty hostname #428
* check declaration of fgets_unlocked for bionic libc #429
* fix parallel build race #431
* added document.browse.sorting_type (and let sort "numerically",
for example kernel versions)
* increase max number of concurrent connections
* extend document.browse.images.display_style, adding value -1 (no
text)
* apply libcss twice (similar to elinks css implementation)
* refresh-view, set-mark, goto-mark and onload-oneshot actions for
exmode #220
* back to smb based on smbclient binary
